From 2d63bafd4fca179828c0d1245a63cd827e7f2e71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Stahl-Gruber <david@gruber.tv>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 16:19:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(upcloud): hand-written Effect client for the UpCloud 1.3
 API

M2+M3 (T2.1-T3.3). UpCloud publishes no OpenAPI spec (the only one that
exists is community, unmaintained, and predates UKS), so this client is
hand-written and exempt from codegen:check -- documented in the README.

Covers UKS clusters and node groups, SDN network/router, and zones, over a
Bearer-token transport with a 429-aware retry. version is part of the
cluster create body: without it every cluster lands on UpCloud's default.

D15 relaxes no-sibling-package-imports for incoming edges to this package
only; its own outgoing edges stay governed. Build order puts it beside core
for the same reason -- it is the one package a sibling depends on.
